 msgctxt "#31695"
-msgid "NVIDIA graphics cards give Kodi no 10-bit output, only an 8-bit one and a 16-bit floating-point one. With this on, HDR10, HLG and any other 10-bit video goes out through the 16-bit one, without the banding of 8 bits. Turn it off if such video shows wrong colours or a black screen: it then goes out through the 8-bit one, as before. Dolby Vision is not affected. Applies from the next video."
