+#: addons/skin.estuary/xml/SettingsSystemInfo.xml
+#. What this build is, and whose product it is not (core #39959)
+msgctxt "#31720"
+msgid "LibreELEC Hades is a modified build of LibreELEC and of the Kodi® media centre. It is not supplied by, endorsed by or a product of the XBMC Foundation, Team Kodi or Team LibreELEC, and they give no support for it: please ask for help where this build is published, not in their forums. Kodi is a registered trademark of the XBMC Foundation.[CR][CR]It is built entirely on their work. To support them: kodi.tv/donate and libreelec.tv"
+msgstr "LibreELEC Hades es una compilación modificada de LibreELEC y del centro multimedia Kodi®. No la suministran ni la avalan la XBMC Foundation, el Team Kodi ni el Team LibreELEC, no es un producto suyo y no le dan soporte: por favor, pida ayuda donde se publica esta compilación, no en los foros de Kodi ni de LibreELEC. Kodi es una marca registrada de la XBMC Foundation.[CR][CR]Está hecha por entero sobre su trabajo. Para apoyarlos: kodi.tv/donate y libreelec.tv"
